# Keep Docker build context small — local build trees, the gitignored
# bootstrapped Irrlicht, and VCS metadata are never needed inside the image
# (docker/Dockerfile bootstraps its own patched Irrlicht from source; see
# P31, refactor/desktop_gl_elimination_plan.md).
.git
build/
build-*/
third_party/irrlicht-gles2-x86/
wt/
*.log
